capability hpack/encode  a header list written as a block: static table, dynamic table, Huffman where no longer
  heroes  http2.encoder, http2.encode_fields, http2.Encoder
  go      http2/hpack.Encoder, http2/hpack.Encoder.WriteField, http2/hpack.NewEncoder
  rust    -
  python  hpack.Encoder
  note    RFC 7541 C.3 to C.6 written byte for byte; a string is Huffman-coded where that is no longer, which C.6.2's "307" needs; a field past three quarters of the table is not indexed

capability hpack/decode  a block read into a header list, the dynamic table kept in step
